    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301601/2003016010320"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それはさ、情けないことでもなんでもないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "作曲、編曲、作詞……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "表に出る情報はこれくらいだけど、\r\n他にも本当にたくさんの人が関わってるよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016010330,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん\r\nこの曲に関わったみんなの気持ちを、わたしが歌にする",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301601/2003016010330"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016010340,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "３人だったら平気なのに、\r\nひとりになったとたん不安になっちゃって",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301601/2003016010340"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016010350,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "誰かを元気づけたり応援するのに、\r\nわたしの全力で足りるのかな？　って",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301601/2003016010350"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016010360,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "でもね、すっごく楽しみなのも本当なんだよ\r\n嬉しいのも、本当",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301601/2003016010360"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは十分わかってるさ\r\nデモと歌詞をもらった時のめぐるを見たら、なぁ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016010370,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あははっ\r\nそんなにわかりやすかった？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301601/2003016010370"
  },
  {
